From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Almeida Barrios <gabarrios2006@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:24:24 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] engine: stop the callee's other devices when one answers

WhatsApp leaves this to the caller, so a call answered on one device went on
ringing on the others until someone answered there too. One <terminate> per
rung device, once. A callee that already saw the caller's <mute_v2> also
accepts on Answer instead of waiting two seconds, since the caller only stops
the other devices on <accept>.

Validated with go test on the stanzas; not yet on a live call.

Source of truth: https://github.com/oxidezap/whatsapp-rust/blob/66a6aa479b79cde35be6d05da0fa987a4b574d46/src/voip/direct_ingress.rs#L522-L589
