+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,16 @@ All notable changes to meowcaller, tracked per module. Format loosely follows
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### engine/ring-dismiss — `implemented`
+
+- After one callee device accepts or declines an outgoing call, the caller
+  sends each other rung device its own `<terminate>` (`accepted_elsewhere` or
+  `rejected_elsewhere`), as WhatsApp Web does; a `busy` or `enc` reject decides
+  nothing for the others. Unit-tested on the stanzas; the live dismiss is not
+  yet validated.
+- A callee whose caller's `<mute_v2>` already came while ringing sends
+  `<accept>` on Answer instead of waiting for one that will not come.
+
 ### api/ongoing-group-join — `implemented`
 
 - Asks the server where a group call stands while the account is not in it
